                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="alert alert-info mb-0" style="font-size:0.85rem;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;">
                        <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i><strong>Send the exact amount</strong> shown above to this GCash number
                      </div>
