                        <span class="d-inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full" style="background:#e0edff;color:#1d4ed8;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;">Step 2: Upload Receipt</span>
