                      <div class="form-text" style="color:#d97706;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle me-1"></i>Upload the receipt for manual verification before your booking is confirmed.</div>
                      <img id="cashProofPreview" alt="Preview" class="img-thumbnail mt-2 d-none" style="max-height:120px;border-radius:10px;" />
